{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/982628-the-resurgence-due-to-a-prank","id":982628,"title":"The Resurgence due to a prank","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-06T03:36:12-07:00","id":982628,"title":"The Resurgence due to a prank","content":"It stands to reason that in a darker version of our own world, conspiracy theories are often true. As such, it also stands to reason that the moon landing was indeed faked in the World of Darkness. But why?<br /> <br /> It occurred to me that the entire Resurgence could have been due to a giant prank played by the pooka (or indeed any coalition of kithain). Perhaps it was an epic bunk used with Dreamcraft to open the ways between worlds.<br /> <br /> How would you play with the idea of the moon landings as something initiated/faked by the fae to flood the world with Glamour? Could other historic events have been orchestrated in a similar fashion? Would the kithain be able to pull it off again? What stories could you tell from this seed?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}